    "markdown": "---\nengine: knitr\n---\n\n# qmd files\n\nQuarto uses `.qmd` which are essentially markdown files (.qmd = quarto markdown).\n\nTheir are 2 major parts in this section: Static, and Interactive.\n\n## Static\n\n- [Markdown](/qmds/markdown.qmd): Link to markdown intro and cheatsheets\n- [Images](/qmds/images.qmd): Adding and formatting images\n- [Callouts](/qmds/callouts.qmd): Callout blocks (e.g. note, tip, warning, etc.)\n- [Icons](/qmds/icons.qmd): <svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" style=\"height:1em;position:relative;display:inline-block;top:.1em;fill:#648fff;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">  <path d=\"M505.12019,19.09375c-1.18945-5.53125-6.65819-11-12.207-12.1875C460.716,0,435.507,0,410.40747,0,307.17523,0,245.26909,55.20312,199.05238,128H94.83772c-16.34763.01562-35.55658,11.875-42.88664,26.48438L2.51562,253.29688A28.4,28.4,0,0,0,0,264a24.00867,24.00867,0,0,0,24.00582,24H127.81618l-22.47457,22.46875c-11.36521,11.36133-12.99607,32.25781,0,45.25L156.24582,406.625c11.15623,11.1875,32.15619,13.15625,45.27726,0l22.47457-22.46875V488a24.00867,24.00867,0,0,0,24.00581,24,28.55934,28.55934,0,0,0,10.707-2.51562l98.72834-49.39063c14.62888-7.29687,26.50776-26.5,26.50776-42.85937V312.79688c72.59753-46.3125,128.03493-108.40626,128.03493-211.09376C512.07526,76.5,512.07526,51.29688,505.12019,19.09375ZM384.04033,168A40,40,0,1,1,424.05,128,40.02322,40.02322,0,0,1,384.04033,168Z\"></path></svg>, \n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" style=\"height:1em;position:relative;display:inline-block;top:.1em;fill:#648fff;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">  <path d=\"M433.941 129.941l-83.882-83.882A48 48 0 0 0 316.118 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h352c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V163.882a48 48 0 0 0-14.059-33.941zM224 416c-35.346 0-64-28.654-64-64 0-35.346 28.654-64 64-64s64 28.654 64 64c0 35.346-28.654 64-64 64zm96-304.52V212c0 6.627-5.373 12-12 12H76c-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12V108c0-6.627 5.373-12 12-12h228.52c3.183 0 6.235 1.264 8.485 3.515l3.48 3.48A11.996 11.996 0 0 1 320 111.48z\"></path></svg>, etc.\n- [Tables](/qmds/tables.qmd): Making tables by \"hand\" and displaying R `data.frames` contents nicely\n- [Github code embed](/qmds/github_code_embed.qmd): Embedding code from a file in a github repo\n\n## Interactive\n\n- [Code](/qmds/code.qmd): Running and/or displaying code\n- [Tippy tooltips](/qmds/tippy_tooltips.qmd): Hovering over underlined text for a <u id='tippy'>tooltip</u> \n- [Webexercises](/qmds/webexercises.qmd): Adding interactive quizzes (MCQs)\n- [Videos](/qmds/videos.qmd): Embedding youtube videos\n\n\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-3a6f6780574f1888e998\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-3a6f6780574f1888e998\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"tippy\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Tippy is an R package to make tooltips\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n",
